WEBVTT

00:03:27.537 --> 00:03:31.708
They thought that she was a little
too aggressive and out for herself.

00:03:32.209 --> 00:03:37.147
Neither female nor male students
wanted to work for or hire Heidi,

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:40.484
but they all thought Howard
would make a great colleague.

00:03:40.484 --> 00:03:41.752
Why?

00:03:41.785 --> 00:03:45.355
Because in our society,
women are penalized

00:03:45.355 --> 00:03:49.092
when we behave in ways
that violate gender norms.

00:03:49.126 --> 00:03:54.464
Our gender stereotypes show
that women should be kind, nurturing,

00:03:54.498 --> 00:03:58.001
helpful, supportive, deferential,

00:03:58.034 --> 00:04:02.439
while traditionally men
are expected to be decisive, competent,